@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Feature Specification: Task timestamps
+
+- **FR-001**: Every task has `createdAt` and `updatedAt`, ISO-8601 date-time strings; equal when added.
+- **FR-002**: complete, reopen, rename, tag and untag set `updatedAt` to the time of the change; `createdAt` never changes. A failed change leaves the task untouched.
+- **FR-003**: The domain reads no clock (constitution): `createTodoList(now?)` takes the clock, defaulting to the system clock outside `src/domain/`.
